    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rebound Hell \u2013 Chaos by Ricochet</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rebound Hell</strong> is a minimalist top-down action game where every bullet you fire is a double-edged sword.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're trapped in a small square arena. Each shot fires a white bullet. If it hits an enemy, it deals damage. But beware: <strong>every time it bounces off a wall, the bullet turns red... and can hurt you instead.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820820/extras/3d2aa925af4f95ec3fc92266ac89a049.poster.avif?t=1752147943\" width=414 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820820/extras/3d2aa925af4f95ec3fc92266ac89a049.webm?t=1752147943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820820/extras/3d2aa925af4f95ec3fc92266ac89a049.mp4?t=1752147943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every white bullet rebound has a chance to spawn an enemy around the arena.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies quickly invade the space, forcing you to manage your shots carefully \u2014 or be overwhelmed by your own ricochets.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You only have 3 HP. Few healing opportunities. No mercy !</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Original Upgrade System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every 10 white bullet bounces, a yellow bullet is fired automatically.<br><strong>Catch it</strong> to trigger a <strong>random upgrade</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820820/extras/0bcf2589c41c0d0442287ace84f6b428.poster.avif?t=1752147943\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820820/extras/0bcf2589c41c0d0442287ace84f6b428.webm?t=1752147943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820820/extras/0bcf2589c41c0d0442287ace84f6b428.mp4?t=1752147943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game-Changing Upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not just stat boosts! Some upgrades completely change your playstyle:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>bomb</strong> that explodes all red bullets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>radar</strong> that slows down enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An <strong>hourglass</strong> that freezes enemies in time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other upgrades react to how many bullets are in play, or how fast you move.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Varied Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 enemy types \u2014 from simple chargers to fast, deadly brains \u2014 including foes that turn into obstacles inside the arena.<br>Each enemy brings new pressure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Maximum Replayability</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique enemy spawn patterns tied to your own bullet rebounds.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-linear difficulty: the longer you survive, the more intense the chaos becomes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820820/extras/76ea0bf1cd14f27cfd7673312aeb6171.poster.avif?t=1752147943\" width=414 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820820/extras/76ea0bf1cd14f27cfd7673312aeb6171.webm?t=1752147943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820820/extras/76ea0bf1cd14f27cfd7673312aeb6171.mp4?t=1752147943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Atmosphere</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultra-minimalist pixel art style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chaotic <strong>dark electro / synthwave</strong> soundtrack that intensifies with each rebound.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rebound Hell \u2013 Chaos by Ricochet</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rebound Hell</strong> is a minimalist top-down action game where every bullet you fire is a double-edged sword.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're trapped in a small square arena. Each shot fires a white bullet. If it hits an enemy, it deals damage. But beware: <strong>every time it bounces off a wall, the bullet turns red... and can hurt you instead.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820820/extras/3d2aa925af4f95ec3fc92266ac89a049.poster.avif?t=1752147943\" width=414 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820820/extras/3d2aa925af4f95ec3fc92266ac89a049.webm?t=1752147943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820820/extras/3d2aa925af4f95ec3fc92266ac89a049.mp4?t=1752147943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every white bullet rebound has a chance to spawn an enemy around the arena.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies quickly invade the space, forcing you to manage your shots carefully \u2014 or be overwhelmed by your own ricochets.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You only have 3 HP. Few healing opportunities. No mercy !</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Original Upgrade System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every 10 white bullet bounces, a yellow bullet is fired automatically.<br><strong>Catch it</strong> to trigger a <strong>random upgrade</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820820/extras/0bcf2589c41c0d0442287ace84f6b428.poster.avif?t=1752147943\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820820/extras/0bcf2589c41c0d0442287ace84f6b428.webm?t=1752147943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820820/extras/0bcf2589c41c0d0442287ace84f6b428.mp4?t=1752147943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game-Changing Upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not just stat boosts! Some upgrades completely change your playstyle:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>bomb</strong> that explodes all red bullets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>radar</strong> that slows down enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An <strong>hourglass</strong> that freezes enemies in time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other upgrades react to how many bullets are in play, or how fast you move.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Varied Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 enemy types \u2014 from simple chargers to fast, deadly brains \u2014 including foes that turn into obstacles inside the arena.<br>Each enemy brings new pressure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Maximum Replayability</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique enemy spawn patterns tied to your own bullet rebounds.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-linear difficulty: the longer you survive, the more intense the chaos becomes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820820/extras/76ea0bf1cd14f27cfd7673312aeb6171.poster.avif?t=1752147943\" width=414 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820820/extras/76ea0bf1cd14f27cfd7673312aeb6171.webm?t=1752147943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820820/extras/76ea0bf1cd14f27cfd7673312aeb6171.mp4?t=1752147943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Atmosphere</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultra-minimalist pixel art style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chaotic <strong>dark electro / synthwave</strong> soundtrack that intensifies with each rebound.</p></li></ul>",
